# Windsurf Rules — Codex Nothing

Read `DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` before building any widget. It contains copy-paste templates, token reference, and concrete examples.

## Critical Rules
- Use container queries (`@min-[300px]:`) NOT viewport queries (`md:`)
- Use CSS tokens (`var(--surface-2)`, `var(--danger)`) NOT hardcoded colors
- Doto font ONLY for clocks, counters, short metrics
- Always run `npm run lint && npm run build` before finishing

## Widget Template
When asked to create a widget, start from the template in `DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` → "Snabbstart — Skapa en ny widget"

